      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i'll skip the tablets. i went to the store but they were out of pedialyte... i think i can just make that homemade mix you mentioned with the sugar and salt? but i'm a little nervous about getting the measurements right. how much exactly should i be giving him at once? like how many ounces or spoonfuls should i do every time i try to give him some so he actually stays hydrated?",
